{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>All</b> — The forms are like לעג, tied always with a lamed." "<b>They open with the lip</b> — They open, like פטר רחם, and the bet is a figure of speech, like לחמו בלחמי. And it is possible that a word is missing."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:09.328661658Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}